--
Attributes:
ProjectileList [list of all instantiated projectiles]
TankList [list of instantiated tanks]
Map
CollectibleList
--
Methods:
Draw() [draws all map entities by calling their draw()'s]
Update() [calls updates of all map entities]
AddProjectile() [adds projectile to ProjectileList]
CheckBulletTankOvelaps() [inflicts damage to tank]
CheckBulletWallOverlaps() [if wall damages, inflicts damage]
--
Responsibilities
Class which performs instantiating, drawing and updating of all map elements.</panel_attributes>
